    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d322">

                <pb facs="0304" n="294" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg294"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Executive Secretariat Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Executive Secretary of the National
                        Security Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Souers</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Council </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-03">March 3, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At the request of the Secretary of State the attached statement on “The Formosan
                    Problem”, which he made at the 35th Meeting of the National Security Council in
                    connection with the Council’s consideration of NSC 37/5<anchor n="87"
                        xml:id="d322-f1"/> on the subject, is circulated herewith for the
                    information of the National Security Council.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d322-a1.xml" xpointer="d322-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
